{"id":"192df17017774c0f","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-typed-many-one-reduction.md","title":"73-df-typed-many-one-reduction — typed many one reduction","display":"73-df-typed-many-one-reduction — typed many one reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-typed-many-one-reduction","display":"73-df-typed-many-one-reduction — typed many one reduction","depends_on":["[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","[[73-df-string-function-computation]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-df-typed-many-one-reduction","73-definition-8.5"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-typed-many-one-reduction"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-typed-many-one-reduction — typed many one reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-typed-many-one-reduction</span><span>73-definition-8.5</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\{\\mathbb N,\\Sigma^*\\}\">\\(X\\in\\{\\mathbb N,\\Sigma^*\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq X\">\\(A,B\\subseteq X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 仅在词载体分支使用；数值分支的定义与该辅助字母表无关。</li>\n<li>数值函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{NumComp}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a>；词函数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 保留原总函数接口；本文件显式固定其载体实例，不混合词与数值应用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computable}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{NumComp},&amp;X=\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}(M,f)\\},&amp;X=\\Sigma^*,\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Computable}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computable}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{NumComp},&amp;X=\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}(M,f)\\},&amp;X=\\Sigma^*,\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Computable}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.5}\\vdash\nA\\leq_mB\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Computable}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.5}\\vdash\nA\\leq_mB\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Computable}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-string-function-computation","status":"resolved","id":"fd9e85296ed6a24d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-string-function-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数值函数类 $\\mathrm{NumComp}$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]；词函数的 $\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-string-function-computation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-string-function-computation","status":"resolved","id":"fd9e85296ed6a24d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数值函数类 $\\mathrm{NumComp}$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]；词函数的 $\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-string-function-computation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\{\\mathbb N,\\Sigma^*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NumComp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computable}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{NumComp},&X=\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}(M,f)\\},&X=\\Sigma^*,\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Computable}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.5}\\vdash\nA\\leq_mB\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Computable}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)","display":true}],"bytes":1607,"backlinks":[{"id":"8d80ca1aa93889a6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\leq_m$ 使用 [[73-df-typed-many-one-reduction]] 的词载体实例；目标语言类见 [[73-df-recursive-language-notation]]。"},{"id":"de6518bc0894c6c3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\leq_m$ 使用 [[73-df-typed-many-one-reduction]] 的词载体实例；目标语言类见 [[73-df-enumerable-language-notation]]。"},{"id":"60183f0de151f1a6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B,C\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\leq_m$ 使用 [[73-df-typed-many-one-reduction]] 的词载体实例。"}],